From 901d4ae72b7101daf97b1a8e1a1a90d40c1aad9f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 13:10:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(api): return 422 when a review profile has no sources

POST /reviews created a pending review for a profile with no GitHub
username, portfolio URL, or resume text, and the background task then
completed that review with sources_count=0. Reject that case before
creating the review, and cover it in tests/unit/test_review_routes.py.

Fixes #36
